# Foray in the Forest (Nisaba and K1n9_Duk3; v2.0) as a Keen Worlds world.
# Written by tools/kw_fitf.py from the game's GPL source; the data files
# beside it are the player's copy of the game. It runs on the engine's Keen
# 5 code, which its own source descends from, so Keen 5's variables are the
# base.

