%string ck_str_storyText
	"\n"
	"Commander Keen in...\n"
	"Episode #\n"
	"\n"
	"Foray in the Forest\n"
	"\n"
	"After his adventures\n"
	"on Vorticon VI,\n"
	"Commander Keen\n"
	"has returned home,\n"
	"ready to resume\n"
	"his life as\n"
	"simple schoolboy\n"
	"Billy Blaze.\n"
	"\n"
	"Saving the galaxy\n"
	"is hard work, after all!\n"
	"\n"
	"But our intrepid\n"
	"hero's adventures\n"
	"are not over yet,\n"
	"as he is soon\n"
	"to discover.\n"
	"\n"
	"Something extremely\n"
	"important is missing\n"
	"from his personal\n"
	"sanctuary.\n"
	"\n"
	"In its place, he finds\n"
	"a single cryptic note,\n"
	"which leads him\n"
	"to a planet\n"
	"with strange rings\n"
	"...\n"

